		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Humanoid whose flesh is made from flowers and vines. Made by druidic magic. Can plant a life-seed and reincarnate.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 6, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 longsword +0 (1d8) or 1 crossbow +0 (1d6), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> -1, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Ghorus Seed</strong>. As an action, expel a seed from body. If planted, the seed sprouts into a duplicate of the ghoran in 2d4 days, retains memories and skills. Original ghoran dies if seed sprouts.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
